# How far a wreck's blast reaches another car (docs/M6B_TANK_TEST_PLAN.md, D7),
# on the tank_blast_reach and tank_blast_reach_15 overlays from
# tank_scenarios.sh. Get in, fire one shell at the middle car, capture the
# screen every 21 ms (about two per 42.86 ms game frame) for 3 s, then once at
# 6.5 s and 12.5 s in case a fire gets the lone car later.
3500 tap esc 80
+2000 tap enter 80
+3000 tap enter 80
+1500 tap enter 80

17000 shot start
+50 tap enter 70
+4000 shot frenzy
+4000 shot ready
+100 tap lctrl 120
+0 burst reach 150 21
+3500 shot after3s
+3000 shot after6s
+6000 shot after12s
+100 quit
